WEBVTT

00:07:58.694 --> 00:08:00.481
As she says,

00:08:00.505 --> 00:08:02.376
"It's a single-function device."

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:07.528
(Laughter)

00:08:07.552 --> 00:08:09.219
"Like, how lame is that?"

00:08:09.896 --> 00:08:12.136
And I say, "No, no,
it tells the date as well."

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:16.160
(Laughter)

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.603
"It has multiple functions."

00:08:18.627 --> 00:08:19.976
(Laughter)

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:23.452
But, you see, there are things
we're enthralled to in education.

00:08:24.033 --> 00:08:25.388
A couple of examples.

00:08:25.412 --> 00:08:28.135
One of them is the idea of linearity:

00:08:28.159 --> 00:08:30.795
that it starts here
and you go through a track